      "source_assessment": "新对象在任何内容写入前进入 delete-pending；创建与该转换之间出现的额外名字会使剩余 links 非零而被拒绝。代码在 write、flush、fsync 全程保持该状态，完成后仅清除标记保留对象，此后没有内容写入。open/stream 异常会关闭句柄；无法确认结果的 Action 仍走 UNKNOWN。现有共享访问标志不再被当作阻止链接的依据。",
      "independently_run_v2_supporting_tests": [
        "test_failed_flush_does_not_publish_a_partial_document_or_allow_retry (tests.m1.test_execution_boundary.DocumentBoundaryTests.test_failed_flush_does_not_publish_a_partial_document_or_allow_retry) ... ok",
        "test_hardlinked_final_object_cannot_be_written_or_treated_as_confirmed_output (tests.m1.test_execution_boundary.DocumentBoundaryTests.test_hardlinked_final_object_cannot_be_written_or_treated_as_confirmed_output) ... ok",
        "test_link_inserted_during_creation_is_rejected_before_any_content_write (tests.m1.test_execution_boundary.DocumentBoundaryTests.test_link_inserted_during_creation_is_rejected_before_any_content_write) ... ok",
        "test_unavailable_unpublished_file_enforcement_prevents_content_write (tests.m1.test_execution_boundary.DocumentBoundaryTests.test_unavailable_unpublished_file_enforcement_prevents_content_write) ... ok",
        "test_unpublished_object_blocks_new_hardlink_before_content_write (tests.m1.test_execution_boundary.DocumentBoundaryTests.test_unpublished_object_blocks_new_hardlink_before_content_write) ... ok",
        "test_pause_freezes_lease_clock_but_does_not_extend_session_credentials (tests.m1.test_execution_boundary.LeaseBoundaryTests.test_pause_freezes_lease_clock_but_does_not_extend_session_credentials) ... ok",
        "test_process_death_before_publication_discards_bytes_and_remains_unknown (tests.m1.test_execution_boundary.ProcessBoundaryTests.test_process_death_before_publication_discards_bytes_and_remains_unknown) ... ok"
      ],
      "sufficiency": "原始 R1 方法的独立 v1 失败/v2 成功对照直接覆盖已确认缺陷；源码检查和独立执行的 v2 M1 套件补充覆盖早期链接、不可用标记能力、刷盘失败和真实进程发布前终止。上述证据足以关闭固定 Provider 范围内的 R1。未执行的新增补强探针不计为通过，也不用于扩大能力声明。",
